Grok eventually returned a verified hard solution, so the family cannot ship at that rung unless the other calls all fail—and the harness’s rule is stricter: any success defeats the level. The remaining hard calls are still being recorded, after which this construction will likely be parked as answer-cap-bound rather than falsely labelled hard.
