+        "cliques, and prune every nonterminal branch before expanding it; without "
+        "that hierarchy one mechanically visits the exponentially large graph."
+    ),
+    "hardness_basis": (
+        "Track B: Section 2, Theorem 2.1 and Algorithm 1 construct the packing "
+        "level by level in O(c*l^(depth+1)) operations; at depth 4 it averaged "
+        "0.0012 seconds and 2,101 counted loop/edge operations over eight seeds "
+        "(a full-graph BFS repair averaged 9,064 operations), whereas prefix-atom "
+        "contraction with early pruning averaged 161 exact local operations."
