codex
Outcome: **`cap_bound`—not rejected and not shipped.**

The paper’s Theorem 2.1 and Algorithm 1 explicitly construct the trees, so only Track B is honest. The official hardening loop solved easy 3/3, medium 3/3, and hard 1/3. Increasing depth would exceed the explicit-witness cap. [Paper](https://arxiv.org/pdf/2310.16463)

