- [Harness metadata](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2310.16463/.meta.json)

G1–G8 pass locally. G9(c) passes: across 1,000 hard seeds, the worst witness was 1,079 characters, 220 atoms, and 185 operations. G9 hint/placebo runs were intentionally omitted after the terminal `cap_bound` verdict. No `REJECTED.md` was created.
