  1145	Thus, we only need to prove the following result.
  1146	
  1147	\begin{lemma}\label{clm-main}
  1148	For each labelled vertex $u\in V(G_s)$ with $|W^u|\geq 2$, Ineq. \begin{align}\label{equation}
  1149	n_1(u)+n_3(u)-|R(u)|\leq \lfloor |W^u|/2\rfloor
