   930	The proof is technical and is via induction. Note that since $G_n$ is a single vertex and $G=G_0$, the induction is from $G_{n}$ to $G_0$.
   931	The basic idea is to use the $U^s$-Steiner trees of $G_s$ to construct appropriate $U^{s-1}$-Steiner trees of $G_{s-1}$. Since each vertex in $G_s$ corresponds to a complete graph in $G_{s-1}$, it
   932	is not a straightforward process to extend $U^s$-Steiner trees of $G_s$ to $U^{s-1}$-Steiner trees of $G_{s-1}$.
   933	
