codex
The structure-aware guess test now samples only normalized candidates that already give every terminal a genuine incident edge in every tree, use only valid graph edges/terminal-free atoms, obey uniqueness, and stay under the public component bound. That removes the main prior caveat: failures are now about global tree packing, not malformed guesses. The full 200,000-sample gate is running.
