codex
The exact language count is now tied to the sampler: terminal-port assignments are counted combinatorially, and all remaining genuine edges/valid atom macros are counted as bounded subsets with tree assignments. The demo language is small enough to enumerate exactly; the shipping language is sampled at full size. So G4/G5 no longer rely on a loose superset.
