-| medium | 3 | 5 | 5 | 2 | 125 | 96 | oracle solved 3/3 |
-| hard | 4 | 5 | 5 | 2 | 625 | 192 | oracle solved 1/3; final writable rung |
-
-There is no shipping preset after the terminal `cap_bound` verdict; `SHIPPING_DIFFICULTY="hard"` remains only so the local measurements identify the last tested rung.
-
-## Gate measurements
-
-| gate | result | measurement |
-|---|---|---|
-| G1 | pass | 12/12 planted witnesses verify across all presets |
-| G2 | pass | 5/5 corruptions rejected with 5 distinct reasons |
